{"id": "Der53z2kchV", "title": "Video by githubsignals", "description": "Shader Skills: AI Shaders That Actually Work\n\nShader Skills gives coding agents the confidence to write graphics code that actually runs. Instead of guessing at math, it feeds them a library of one hundred and eighty-six pre-tested functions that compile perfectly on the first try. Think of it as a cheat sheet for digital artists, where every tool is verified to work before you use it. So when you ask an A.I. to build a swirling ocean or a rocky mountain, it grabs the right pieces and snaps them together without breaking. It\u2019s like having a master craftsman whispering the correct formulas into the machine\u2019s ear. No more broken code, just beautiful, working art that looks intentional.\n\nOpen source: gokayfem/shader-skills\n\nFollow for more open source project drops.\n\n#Shaders #ProceduralArt #CreativeCoding #DigitalArtists #ClaudeCode", "channel": "githubsignals", "uploader_id": "36619078976", "uploader": "Github Signals", "timestamp": 1792434638, "like_count": 198, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18109272755222977a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 41.066, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN8WsF9nmpcCbLrAEXzPmv3Bxh9gHaUjGcBCcVHkjGDDX_nAL_l1H-kF9a3DPFYnTIHBR89uj3B20a33YyYESNQdj6npdQ-vDZMt74.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=qMX_J7nzOvkQ7kNvw